<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Trader vs factory</h3><p>NCR has more trading offices per square kilometre than anywhere in the trade — verification is step zero here.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/import-compliance/"><h3>Upholstery compliance</h3><p>Fire-safety labelling for UK-bound upholstered goods physically checked at PSI.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Consolidation risk</h3><p>Multi-source orders assembled for shipping — CLS with per-factory tally keeps the container honest.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><p class="prose rv">The NCR belt (Delhi, Gurgaon, Noida, Faridabad) mixes genuine manufacturers with a dense layer of export houses and traders. It's the cluster where knowing exactly who you're dealing with matters most—and where our verification workload is heaviest.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Pre-Shipment Inspection</h3><p>AQL 2.5, moisture, structure, finish vs golden sample — report in 24h.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Supplier Verification</h3><p>Unannounced premises visits, verdict in 3–5 working days.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/factory-audit-india/"><h3>Factory Audit</h3><p>8-section scored audit for programme onboarding.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Container Loading Supervision</h3><p>Tally, dunnage, weather hold and photographed seal.</p></a></div></div></section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
